Hi, I need help in syntax... How can I do the model below using a robust alternative (t-distribution)?

model <- ' # direct effect
             Y ~ c*X
           # mediator
             M ~ a*X
             Y ~ b*M
           # indirect effect (a*b)
             ab := a*b
           # total effect
             total := c + (a*b)
         '
fit <- sem(model, data = Data)
summary(fit)

Thanks a lot,

Danilo (Brazil)

